              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rahabu tidár tsaatuso'o nee mar'eefoowós sleémeero Yoshua gina slafíngwí máy. Rahabu ina hót tla/ángw múk Israeli wa ale tam ay laarí, asma inós mukdaádá' Yoshua aa qawti ya/aáw as gixsár Yeriko ngiwa tsawtsawuusiya', guna lú/ baraá do'ós i alé.",
          "type": "text",
